Package: node-red-contrib-abraflexi
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, node-red (>= 4.0)
Description: Node-RED input node for AbraFlexi Changes-API webhooks
 Receives AbraFlexi (FlexiBee) webhook POST requests and emits one
 Node-RED message per change record, enabling event-driven flows that
 react to ERP changes in near real-time without polling.
 .
 Output message properties:
  payload       — raw change record object from winstrom.changes[]
  topic         — evidence type, e.g. faktura-vydana (string)
  operation     — create, update, or delete (string)
  globalVersion — AbraFlexi global database version counter (string)
 .
 Optional X-FB-Hook-SecKey header validation. Secret stored encrypted
 in Node-RED credentials.
